WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:03.980
All I want in life... is something to drink!

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:34.900
"Episode 2: Sneak In! The Principal's Office"

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:38.780
Life here's pretty great, I'll admit.

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:41.740
But it sucks not having
any of that stuff to drink.

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:42.580
Yup.

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:45.500
I know. Once you've had it...

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:46.290
Yeah.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:50.120
But they don't sell it in this world.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:54.170
The legendary potion that's
the mother of all medicines?

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:56.300
No, it's not that special.

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:01.760
So what the hell do they sell there?

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.010
I wonder if we can get it somewhere...

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.850
Lt. Koenig. Lt. Neumann.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.270
I actually found it somewhere.

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:09.940
Where?

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:12.210
Get this. The principal's office.

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:12.770
"Principal's Office"

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:15.860
I saw it in there the other day.

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:18.900
You're very buuuusy, huh?

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:21.870
It's only for two days.

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:23.780
I'll be back the day after tomorrow.

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:26.330
See you theeeen.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:27.790
Was it the red stuff?

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:29.920
Yes, the red stuff.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:32.170
If the principal was drinking it,

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.460
that means it must be in
the principal's office, right?

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:36.130
Almost certainly.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:40.570
And what's more, he'll be away on
business the whole of tomorrow.

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:44.180
What do we do then?

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.470
No need to even ask.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:47.520
Yup.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:51.540
Okay, let's start planning.

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:54.980
That's an abandonment
of your duties as a teacher.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:58.570
Freedom is something that's given as
a reward for responsibility and talent.

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:02.070
That sounds like what
a hard-headed demon would say.

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:05.330
As an individual, I have the right
to exercise my freedom.

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.830
Haven't you heard of the right to do wrong?

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:09.330
I'm not interested in the rights of fools.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:12.460
That way of thinking leads to destruction.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.420
Destruction! How wonderful!

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:15.960
That's just what I want--

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.090
Oops. Seems we're out of time.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.160
That's all for today.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:26.510
Okay, let's get to work.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:29.930
Just in case, let's use my skill,
Stealth, to get inside.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:30.890
Yup.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.480
--Okay, let's go.
--Hey, what are you up to?

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.310
Geh! Aqua!

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:36.610
What's with the "geh"?

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.980
You were making suspicious glances
just now, weren't you?

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:42.360
I was wondering if you were
up to something fun, so I followed you.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.780
This is the principal's office!

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:45.530
What are you doing here?

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:49.080
We're going to get some of
the red stuff in the principal's office.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.080
You idiot! Don't tell her!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.040
The red stuff?

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:53.710
<i>The</i> red stuff?

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:57.040
Should I have kept my mouth shut?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.420
Is she the type to get
seriously mad about drinking?

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:01.590
No, that's not a problem, but...

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:06.220
I looked for the bubbly stuff
and couldn't find it anywhere.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.260
I'm willing to resort to the red stuff!

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:09.890
So it's in the principal's office, huh?

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.600
Let's take some.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:12.690
Rejoice!

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:16.970
I, Aqua, the water goddess, will accompany you
and aide you in your efforts!

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:18.360
She's really nice!

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:21.900
Guys, you need to realize
this mission just got a lot harder.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:22.720
What do you mean?

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:25.660
Her luck is utter shit.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.840
Seriously?

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:32.210
Comin' through...

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.790
So, where is it?

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:38.250
Is that it over there?

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.700
Oh, that!

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:42.140
Let's grab it then!

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:44.880
Aqua, think before you act!

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.120
This must be it!

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:47.590
Wow, it's good stuff!

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:49.550
You idiot! Don't touch it!

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:55.480
You impudent fools!

00:04:57.810 --> 00:04:59.150
What is this?

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.230
A trap!

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:11.380
Well, that's a pain.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.170
This is fatal, huh?

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.000
Yup.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.420
This is your fault for not
thinking before you acted!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.960
It's not my fault!

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:24.970
I never thought there'd be a trap!

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.630
We were foolish as well.

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:28.770
We've spent too much time
in a peaceful environment.

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:32.440
If the battalion commander
sees us like this, we're done for.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:33.770
She'll tell us we should've
been more careful!

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:37.400
No, she'll tell us we shouldn't have
tried to steal the red stuff.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:38.190
Yup.

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:41.900
Anyway, let's get out of here! It's scary!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:44.330
Look, the entrance is unguarded!

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:45.230
If we can get over there...

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:47.380
There was no entrance over there.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:48.240
Yup.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:53.200
There was no door there.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.170
Kazuma! It was a monster! A monster!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:02.040
Aqua, are you having memory problems?

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:06.050
Yup!

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:11.760
And we're done.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:16.430
Now we've successfully
disarmed all the traps.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:20.240
Now all we need to do is get out of here
and get the red stuff into a glass,

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:22.440
and it's mission accomplished, right?

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:23.270
Yup!

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:24.440
What's wrong, Kazuma?

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.490
This frame...

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:27.780
Something bothering you?

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:29.360
No, it's just my imagination, maybe.

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:31.030
I was just curious about the emblem.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.780
It's the flag of our Empire.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:34.830
Yeah.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:39.790
Yeah. The principal is one of the big shots
at our country's strategic HQ.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.570
And he prepared all these traps?

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:44.090
Scary old guy.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:45.450
You've got that right!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:51.840
Hey, forget all that. Let's go!

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.970
Yup, time to split...

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:57.430
Yeah, that ain't happening!

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:59.800
What? What? What?

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:01.230
Prepare for combat, everyone!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.630
What? What? What?

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.010
What's going on here?

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:12.200
Giant toads!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.050
Monsters from our world!

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:16.480
--Are they strong?
--They're...! They're really not.

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:17.160
Then...

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.540
But punching them doesn't work.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:27.050
Neumann! Grantz!

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.220
This is bad! We'll be wiped out!

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:33.760
Yes. But we have to protect this,
no matter what!

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:36.600
Fortunately, there are only four giant toads!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:39.140
And they can only swallow one person each!

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.560
Which means...

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:43.770
If two of us sacrifice ourselves
to allow one to escape with it,

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.940
the mission will be a success!

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:49.110
The mission's a success
if even one of us survives!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.400
Yeah. Let's entrust everything to Aqua!

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:52.360
Kazuma!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.570
That's right.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:56.580
This is a man's job.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:00.700
Aqua, when we make it out of this,
let's all have a drink.

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:01.830
Horse-faced man!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:02.730
My name is Koenig!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.290
Forget about me! Go!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:10.840
Horse-faced man!

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:12.300
Horse-faced man!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.990
We won't forget your sacrifice.

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:16.510
There's only one left.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:17.850
Go for it, Kazuma!

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:18.720
Go for what?

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:20.220
What do you mean, go for what?

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:25.270
I ain't jumping in the
mouth of no giant toad.

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:27.820
Why would I?

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.110
Not happening.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:31.110
So, have fun, Aqua.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.700
Skill: Stealth.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:37.510
Wait!

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.280
Just... wait!

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:43.120
I'll get you, Kazuma!

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:49.800
Neumann, Grantz, horse-faced man, and Aqua.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:52.090
I'll never forget your sacrifice!

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:03.100
Save me! Somebody save me!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.520
You there! I'm under attack!

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.900
Save me! If you save me,
I'll grant you my divine protection!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:11.780
Shield Prison.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:14.650
What are you doing?!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.120
I'll get you for this!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.620
I'll bring down divine punishment on you!

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:22.770
God, huh?

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:24.460
Naofumi?

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.260
No one is more untrustworthy
than those who speak of God.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.390
The red stuff...

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:41.430
...is mine!

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:44.770
What are you dooooing?

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:50.220
Well, um...

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:54.400
I understand how you feeeeel.

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.360
Ram, you ratted us out to the teacher!

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:57.200
Of course.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.090
I'm on Mr. Roswaal's side.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:05.860
Grantz. Neumann. Koenig. Aqua.

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:08.120
And Kazuma.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:13.590
I'm sorry, but you're not allowed
to break the school rules.

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:18.570
You're all getting... deteeeention!

00:10:19.640 --> 00:11:50.787
Damn it!
